---
title: "signInWithDiscord (AttendanceZen: Blueprint)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_init: supabase = createSupabaseServerClient()
    q_init --> q_oauth: supabase.auth.signInWithOAuth(discord, scopes=identify+email+guilds.members.read)
    q_oauth --> q_error: error returned
    q_error --> [*]: redirect to /login?error=discord_signin_failed
    q_oauth --> q_check_url: no error
    q_check_url --> q_redirect: data.url exists
    q_redirect --> [*]: redirect to Discord authorization URL

    note right of q_oauth
        INV-001: OAuth uses Supabase PKCE flow with Discord provider
        INV-002: scopes include guilds.members.read for server membership check
        INV-003: redirectTo points to /auth/callback
    end note
